      "form_guide": "",
      "comment": "KIANDO ESTATE (8) has been beaten for early speed lately, last time finishing seventh (18.99) in a Grade 4 at this track. Has a good record here at this journey. Should be very hard to beat this time. TRALEE WILLY (1) was in the minors two back (18.88) at this track but ran below best last time at Gunnedah, finishing 7th. Goes very well here at the trip finding the frame in each of three starts. Great chance to atone. SPRING FRED (7) has shown good improvement at his last two starts, finishing in the money last time when 3rd at Richmond over 320m. Can measure up. BILLIE GIRL (3) is in form and worth thought again.",
